# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Secrets — never commit
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
*.token
.env
*.pat
credentials*

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Internal Jira DATA — deliberately excluded
#
# Bulk extracts of ERC's Jira: issue keys, request summaries, requester names.
# The code and the documentation belong in a repo; the company's issue data
# does not, and pushing it to a git host moves it outside Jira's access control.
#
# All of it can be regenerated with the scripts in tools/.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
_raw/
state/
reports/*.csv
reports/*.json
reports/*.xlsx

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Runtime output
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
*.log

# Office / LibreOffice lock files — written while a document is open
.~lock.*#
~$*
